WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.020
SCP-035 Vs SCP-106.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.839
The Possessive Mask Vs The Old Man.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:10.280
Which one of these two incredibly evil SCPs
would win out in a battle?

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.629
Let’s find out.

00:00:11.629 --> 00:00:16.789
035 is a theatrical mask that takes over and
kills its victims with its powerful brainwaves.

00:00:16.789 --> 00:00:20.539
It also leaks a corrosive black fluid that
breaks down human bodies.

00:00:20.539 --> 00:00:26.339
This is something it actually has in common
with SCP-106, which also leaks corrosive black

00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:31.230
fluid, in addition to being able to walk through
walls and drag people into its nightmare pocket

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.230
dimension.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:36.390
We’d argue that the truly frightening outcome
here is not a fight, but an alliance.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:42.430
If 106 was able to wear 035 and survive, the
result could be an anomaly with their combined

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:48.190
power set - All the terrifying abilities of
106, with added intelligence and mental manipulation

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.010
abilities from 035.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.500
A true force to be reckoned with.

